{
 "_doc": "Spire map length and type budget per act. A zone picks its profile from its zones/index.json `act` (profileByAct); a zone JSON may set `mapProfile` to a profile id or an inline object to override. mode weighted = the original per-node type table (long spire); mode budget = exact map-wide counts [min,max] per type placed inside the `where` floor windows, the rest fights. Fixed floors: floor 0 is all fights, floor preBossRest is one campfire, the last floor is the boss. encCount / tierCurve / eliteTier / extra tune run.js pickEncounter (enemies per fight, how far down the weak-to-strong encounter list a floor may reach, escorts added to elites and bosses); combatMods layers on the heroic modifiers (enemyHpMult number or per tier, *Strength added); goldMult scales fight and treasure gold; normalGearRate = chance a normal-fight win drops a gear piece. 2026-10-21: per-act full3..full6 profiles ramp enemy HP (acts 3-6 previously had no combatMods at all: act-3 clear was 98-100% in act-sim while act 2 was a 40-60% cliff); medium boss 1.7 -> 1.5; goldMult short 0.3 -> 0.6, medium 0.6 -> 0.8 so a normal act-1 fight pays 6-12 gold instead of 3-6.",
